# Convex settings the pipeline SETS on the production deployment before every
# functions deploy. Non-secret values only — this file is in git.
#
# Whether production sends messages (OUTREACH_LIVE) and runs its scheduled jobs
# is a business decision made on the deployment itself, not something a code
# push should change — so neither is here.

# The live Qdrant, by its name on the career141 network. The code falls back to
# the same address; pinned so the setting is visible rather than implied.
QDRANT_URL=http://qdrant:6333
